{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A simple and relaxing casual puzzle game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/snow.png?t=1747633657\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two adjacent snowflakes automatically merge into a larger snowflake. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add snowflakes to the grid until you form the target snowflake to complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/snow.png?t=1747633657\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elegant minimalist pixel art design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soothing sound effects and visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twelve progressively challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calm and stress-relieving gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725520?t=1747633657","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/3792f97ceae64e6d1c116cf96b327db9707332e0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747633657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/fc539aecfca26b4b4883ed6737847f043b2c1fc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747633657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/fc539aecfca26b4b4883ed6737847f043b2c1fc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747633657","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A simple and relaxing casual puzzle game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p